{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1537410-shards","id":1537410,"title":"Shards?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-06-15T11:04:11-07:00","id":1537410,"title":"Shards?","content":"So, any news on Mythic Shards yet? Very keen to know what it is!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28526-elegy","name":"Elegy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-15T11:26:13-07:00","id":1537413,"title":"","content":"We should get news at the Scion panel,tonight at 9:30 est","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-15T19:39:54-07:00","id":1537454,"title":"","content":"Thanks Nicolas <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28526-elegy","name":"Elegy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-15T19:44:29-07:00","id":1537455,"title":"","content":"Well, what about the shards?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-15T22:15:08-07:00","id":1537462,"title":"","content":"Just keen to know what we know \ud83d\ude05<br /> So interested!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28526-elegy","name":"Elegy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-16T00:26:06-07:00","id":1537466,"title":"","content":"Much like Shards of the Exalted Dream, it's a collection of alternate settings for Scion. Courtesy of Discord, the included shards are:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>After the End - Bad news, y'all. ALL the Apocalypses happened. They Apocalypsed so hard that the Gods are either gone or cut off. So you're gonna be the new generation of Scions in a while, and if you become Gods you'll be new Gods.</li> <li>Cyber-Scion, a buckwild Cyberpunk-type future Shard, featuring not only corporate overlord assholes, but also God-Machine Mecha and Kaiju you can fight with those God-Machines</li> <li>Farewell to Heroes - Something in the past happened and now Heroes and Scions are very mistrusted by the general public. There's a lot of heist/crime/noir type stuff. X-Men Days of Future Past.</li> <li>Four-Colors - The exact opposite of tone of No More Heroes, where you're going Max Goldenage Superhero. Suits, supervillains, the whole nine yards.</li> <li>Scion Space Age - Star Trek meets Scion, with rules for alien denizen types, starships, and spaceship combat</li> </ol>Further shards may be added in crowdfunding, such as a Wild West/Wuxia setting and an eldritch horror one, apparently distinct from Masks of the Mythos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-16T15:55:27-07:00","id":1537527,"title":"","content":"One and four sound tasty five is a dream for me.<br /> <br /> If the Shards book sells well, might the shards/settings get further details and maybe books?<br /> <br /> I hope the Wuxia one gets included.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-16T21:56:07-07:00","id":1537544,"title":"","content":"I love the sound of 1 and 3 as settings (my WoD background showing, no doubt).<br /> <br /> As a fan of Kitchen Sink settings, I hope they include mechanics that we can put into the base game too: new Callings, different ways to gather and use Legend, etc.<br /> <br /> I love the idea of turning the mechanics from 1 (which will presumably cover becoming a Scion without a Visitation, if not without a divine parent) into a plot point in an otherwise normal game: a \u201cself made\u201d Scion appears and a whole lot of Gods panic <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28526-elegy","name":"Elegy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}